<c.magenta> Dors min p'tit quinquin 
 Min p'tit... Min p'tit... </c>

00:12:43.560 --> 00:12:44.880 line:95%
<c.yellow> -Et entre les deux ? </c>

00:12:45.040 --> 00:12:46.440 line:95%
 "Min p'tit pouchin, 

