<c.yellow> "min gros rojin." </c>

00:12:47.760 --> 00:12:49.240 line:95%
<c.yellow> "Mon petit poussin, </c>

00:12:49.400 --> 00:12:51.040 align:start position:0% line:68%
 "mon gros raisin." 
 Je traduis. 

00:12:51.200 --> 00:12:53.040 size:27% position:13% line:74%
 -Parfait. 

